---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Gallery from '../../components/Gallery.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Flight Simulator"
  description="I needed a means of air travel during quarantine, so I built this simulator cockpit structure out of pine."
  image="/images/flight-simulator-2.jpg"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Flight Simulator</h1>
    </header>
    <article class="project">
      <Gallery
        variant="hero-side"
        images={[
          { src: '/images/flight-simulator-2.jpg', alt: 'Flight simulator cockpit' },
          { src: '/images/render-1.jpg', alt: 'Flight simulator 3D render' },
          { src: '/images/render2-1.jpg', alt: 'Flight simulator 3D render, other angle' },
        ]}
      />
      <p>I needed a means of air travel during quarantine, so I built this simulator cockpit structure out of pine.</p>
      <p>
        This simulator uses a Logitech X52 stick and throttle and Logitech Rudder Pedals as well as 34″ 1440p Acer monitor.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
